<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Seven in A$325 mln capital raising.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Seven in A$325 mln capital raising.</headline>
<text>
<p>SYDNEY, July 18 (Reute) - Television operator Seven Network Ltd said on Friday that it would raise A$325 million from a two-pronged capital raising involving an equity raising in Australia and a debt placement in the United States.</p>
<p>The company said as part of the raising it had completed the placement of 13.8 million shares with institutional and other investors at A$5.43 per share, raising A$75 million.</p>
</text>
